Established a trust relationship between Red Hat Identity Management and Active Directory using the ipa trust-add command
Configured DNS forwarders and verified proper name resolution between domains
Verified trust status and configured appropriate trust settings including ID ranges and SSSD integration
Tested cross-domain authentication by enabling AD users to log into IdM-managed systems
Implemented group mapping to allow AD groups to be used for authorization in the IdM environment
